SUMMARY:Dinner with amauta\, Mama Elena - Indigenous Spiritual Leader
DESCRIPTION:Mama Elena Martinez (Abya Yala Runa) is an Amauta (high shama
 n and medicine person) and co-founder and co-leader of the Association of
  Yatiris and Amautas of Bolivia\, dedicated to preserving and sharing Ind
 igenous spiritual and healing traditions. Co-hosted by Int'l Studies\, CL
 ACS\, NAIS Program\, Latino Studies\, FNECC and La Casa. RSVP at lacasa@i
 u.edu.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">
 Mama Elena Martinez (Abya Yala Runa) is an Amauta (high shaman and medici
 ne person) and co-founder and co-leader of the Association of Yatiris and
  Amautas of Bolivia\, dedicated to preserving and sharing Indigenous spir
 itual and healing traditions. Co-hosted by Int'l Studies\, CLACS\, NAIS P
 rogram\, Latino Studies\, FNECC and La Casa. RSVP at lacasa@iu.edu.</span
 ></p>
